 "summary": "Design of control and return paths for a native test. Where ADB is lost: from Android shutdown until Android is back; between those points only the screen and possibly RAM log rings remain. The independent control plane: the owner, the hardware watchdog (unmeasured), the S-Boot reboot reason (binary-derived), Download Mode with the host restore tool, and passive USB observation. A staged watchdog/one-shot validation plan W0-W5 separates the software timeout from the hardware watchdog. The manual fallback is the keys, then Download Mode, then restoring only the stock recovery. The plan also covers a RAM root with no storage access and conditions that prohibit any autonomous native loop. Nothing was run on the phone; every return path is marked measured or not.",
